              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A wing? (पक्षः, pakṣaḥ.) A tail? (पुच्छः, pucchaḥ.) A horn? (शृंगम्, śṛṅgam.) A beak? (चञ्चुः, cañcuḥ.) A vulture? (गृध्रः, gṛdhraḥ.) History? (इतिहासः, itihāsaḥ.) Geography? (भूगोलः, bhūgolaḥ.) Music? (संगीतम्, saṅgītam.) Dance? (नृत्यम्, nṛtyam.) Painting? (चित्रकला, citrakalā.)"
